Show the names olr keeps current

Usage:
  olr dial show [flags]
  olr dial show [command]

Available Commands:
  providers   List the DNS providers olr can publish through
  record      Show one name in full
  records     List the names olr keeps current

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for show

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr dial show [command] --help" for more information about a command.
